            <div type="bibliography">
                
            </div>
            <div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT7940PPAynaTela">
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet225">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 225</ref> according to the catalogue description in 
                        <bibl>  <ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/>
                            <citedRange unit="page">697</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/>
                        ጸሎት<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied>
                        በእንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ ዓይነ፡ ጥላ፡ ወዓይነ፡ <choice resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">
                            <sic>ት</sic>
                            <corr>ተ</corr>
                        </choice>ጻራሪ፡ ወዓይነ፡ አገርጋር፡ ወዓይነ፡ ቡዳ፡ ወዓይነ፡ <surplus>ወ</surplus>ጠቢብ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied>
                        ወዓይነ፡ <choice>
                            <sic>ቁረኛ፡</sic>
                            <corr>ቍራኛ፡</corr>
                        </choice> ወዓይነ፡ አ<choice resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">
                            <sic>ጋ</sic>
                            <corr>ገ</corr>
                        </choice>ርጋር፡ ወዓይነ፡ ባለ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> 
                        ጋራ፡ ወዓይነ፡ ነሃቢ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/>
                        ቃለ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይመትር፡ ነደ፡ እሳት፡ </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMIP00075">Portland, Ethiopic Manuscript Imaging Project, Weiner Codex 1</ref> .</note>  
                    <ab>ብስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="ESh"/> ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ ዓይነ፡ ጥላ፡ <supplied reason="omitted">አ</supplied>ገርጋሪያ፡ ዓይነ፡ ባርያ፡ ወሌጌዎን፡ ዓይነ፡ ቡዳ፡ ወዓይነ፡ ጠቢብ፡ ዓይነ፡ መቅኛ፡ ወዓይነ፡
                        <sic>ወትንኰልኛ፡</sic> <sic>መንኛ፡</sic> ወጕሥምት፡ ወለሕማመ፡ አስወንውንውን፡ ወለሽንትምፅ፡ ወጐርኍሆ፡ ወጊርባ፡ ጀርባ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis" resp="ESh"/></ab>
                </div>
            </div>
